# P12-MESH-003 G5 fix -- thermal solver instrumentation (scratch program thermal_instrument.cpp, linked against
# build/release/src/libcfdcore.a). Part 1 replays the production ThermalSolver Picard loop (assembleEnergyEquation +
# BiCGSTAB, default settings: outer tolerance 1e-8, linear abs 1e-12 / rel 1e-10) on the committed G5 case and records
# per outer iteration: linear residual |b(T^k)-A(T^k)T^{k+1}|, CONSISTENT residual |b(T^{k+1})-A(T^{k+1})T^{k+1}| (the
# equation assembled from the field being returned), field update max|dT|, max adiabatic boundary-value change,
# heat in/out of T^{k+1}, G5 temperature L2 error and heat-flow spread. Part 2 sweeps the outer tolerance on the three
# G5 grids with the production ThermalSolver (the real runPicardLoop).

