## AFTER the fix (final code): exact gradient-type boundary assembly (boundaryDiffusionContribution) + attained-breakdown
## acceptance in runPicardLoop. Part 1 is an external replay of the loop with plain BiCGSTAB (it has the exact assembly but
## not the breakdown rule); 'lagged adiabatic flux' = Df (T_P^{k+1} - T_P^k) over the hot half = the flux the PRE-fix
## assembly would carry; in the fixed assembly the insulated faces contribute exactly nothing. Part 2 = production solver.
# part 1: production Picard loop replayed, sector 12x30x3, tolerance 1e-08, linear rel 1e-10
